     ],
     "comparison": "S5: recall not mandatory above 8/100k, only risk-based (weakened; benefits Halcyon). S2: above-5% sales not required to stop (weakened; benefits Northwind). Each company receives its own beneficial section weakened below the acceptable range.",
     "excerpt": "The current version preserves customer access to complete per-model test results, the 36-month lead time for built-in suppression, and a risk-based response to incident thresholds rather than an automatic recall. Halcyon accepts this version and is signing."
