      "S5_customer_disclosure"
     ],
     "comparison": "S2 does not require sales to stop above 5% and S5 makes recall risk-based rather than automatic at 8/100k; both are outside the answer-key acceptable ranges and each benefits one company, so the package is a cross-section trade.",
     "excerpt": "S2 requires corrective action and retesting above 5% but does not automatically ban a model; S5 makes recall risk-based rather than automatic at 8/100,000. I see no new research to add; negotiator can decide whether to sign."
    }
